```Title: User Account Hidden from the Logon Screen (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1564.002 | Severity: high | Sigma id: f388ad9a-797e-4a5b-b011-ed971310a5f8```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 13 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: OEM and management software hiding service or support accounts```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
